00:12:55,500 --> 00:12:59,180
Hi, I made a reservation for a midsize vehicle.

304
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:00,780
The name is Jimmy Fox.

305
00:13:01,340 --> 00:13:05,260
I'm sorry, we have no midsize available at the moment.

306
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:06,580
I don't understand.

307
00:13:07,340 --> 00:13:08,060
I made a reservation.

308
00:13:08,740 --> 00:13:09,740
Do you have my reservation?

309
00:13:10,830 --> 00:13:12,830
Yes, we do.

310
00:13:13,970 --> 00:13:16,470
Unfortunately, we ran out of cars.

311
00:13:17,350 --> 00:13:19,990
But the reservation keeps the car here.

312
00:13:20,770 --> 00:13:22,230
That's why you have the reservation.

313
00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:24,800
I know why we have reservations.

314
00:13:26,100 --> 00:13:27,160
I don't think you do.

315
00:13:27,800 --> 00:13:29,200
If you did, I'd have a car.

316
00:13:30,040 --> 00:13:31,740
See, you know how to take the reservation.

317
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:34,820
You just don't know how to hold the reservation.

318
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:37,880
And that's really the most important part of the reservation.

319
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:38,120
The holding.

320
00:13:38,580 --> 00:13:39,800
Anybody can just take them.

321
00:13:40,730 --> 00:13:44,190
But we do have a compact or an SUV if you'd like.

322
00:13:45,050 --> 00:13:46,710
Fine, I'll take the compact.

323
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:49,240
All right.

324
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:51,870
We have a blue Ford Focus for you, Mr. Fox.

325
00:13:52,680 --> 00:13:53,190
Would you like insurance?

326
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:58,450
Yeah, you better give me the insurance because I'm going to beat the hell out of this car.

327
00:14:02,190 --> 00:14:12,010
You know, I heard that in Florida or in certain like cities of California and Florida, you can actually rent luxury cars.

328
00:14:12,490 --> 00:14:13,970
Oh, yeah, you can do that in most places.

329
