You can rent like a Porsche or a Lamborghini or a Ferrari.

330
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:28,000
Yeah, obviously it costs a lot of money, but it gives you the opportunity to maybe drive one of these cars that you obviously wouldn't have the money to buy.

331
